---
import ChevronDown from '@lucide/astro/icons/chevron-down';
import { site } from '../../data/site';

const items = [
  {
    q: 'Is TOEFLY the official TOEFL test?',
    a: `No. TOEFLY prepares you for the TOEFL iBT in its 2026 format, but it is an independent product. ${site.trademark}`,
  },
  {
    q: 'How accurate is the predicted band?',
    a: 'It is an estimate from your answers and mock exams, and it is always labelled that way. When there is too little data, you see how many tasks are left before a prediction instead of a number.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do I need a tutor to use it?',
    a: 'No. Most learners study on their own and Toefly Tutor plans their weeks. If you work with a tutor, they can join you on the Tutor plan and approve each week.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What happens after the free week?',
    a: 'Your plan and progress stay. To keep getting new weeks, mock exams and unlimited AI checks, switch to Pro or join a tutor who has a Tutor plan.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Which devices does it work on?',
    a: 'The web app works in any current browser on a computer or phone. The iPhone app is in testing and shares the same account.',
  },
];
---

<section class="section faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="faq-title">Questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="items">
      {items.map((item) => (
        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>{item.q}</span>
            <ChevronDown size={20} aria-hidden="true" />
          </summary>
          <p>{item.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: calc(760px + var(--gutter) * 2);
  }

  .items {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  summary {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    min-height: 56px;
    padding: 14px 0;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }

  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  summary :global(svg) {
    flex: none;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    transition: transform var(--motion-base) var(--ease-standard);
  }

  details[open] summary :global(svg) {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  details p {
    padding-bottom: 18px;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    max-width: 64ch;
  }
</style>
